   "q": "<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Receptionist:</b> Good morning, Blue Wave Sports Centre.</div><div><b>Mrs. Er:</b> Hello. Could I speak to the swimming coach, Mr. Tuna?</div><div><b>Receptionist:</b> (1) ---- He's in the pool with a class right now.</div><div><b>Mrs. Er:</b> I see. (2) ----</div><div><b>Receptionist:</b> Of course. Go ahead.</div><div><b>Mrs. Er:</b> My son, Arda, is ill, so he can't come to today's lesson.</div><div><b>Receptionist:</b> (3) ----</div></div><p>Which of the following is <b>NOT</b> used in the conversation?</p>",
