   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Agent:</b> Good evening, Starlight Cinema. How can I help you?</div><div><b>Ms. Çelik:</b> Hi. I booked three tickets online for the 8 p.m. film, but now I need four. Can you add one more seat next to ours?</div><div><b>Agent:</b> Let me check... ----</div><div><b>Ms. Çelik:</b> Oh, that's fine. My son can sit there. Please add it to my booking.</div></div><p>Which of the following best completes the conversation?</p>",
